{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22277","headline":"立春後五日 · 白居易","name":"立春後五日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"立春後五日，春态纷婀娜。\n白日斜渐长，碧云低欲堕。\n残冰坼玉片，新萼排红颗。\n遇物尽欣欣，爱春非独我。\n迎芳後园立，就暖前檐作。\n还有惆怅心，欲别红炉火。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}